  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tBookkeeping\n\t\tBookkeeping FAQs\n\n### Error 7912: Getting the error while verifying the subcontractor\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Mon, 25 Oct, 2021 at  3:02 PM\n\nThe error will get generated when the contractor’s work reference in a verification request is invalid. Please correct the reference and resend the request. \n\nTo do this please go to :\n\nNavigation: Bookkeeping >> Select Client >> CIS >> Subcontractor\n\nUnder action please click the edit dropdown.\n\nThen edit the work reference as necessary\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115344\">Bookkeeping</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188520\">Bookkeeping FAQs</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">Error 7912: Getting the error while verifying the subcontractor\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Mon, 25 Oct, 2021 at  3:02 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p><br></p><p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">The error will get generated when the contractor’s work reference in a verification request is <strong>invalid.</strong> Please correct the reference and resend the request.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">To do this please go to :</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">Navigation:</strong><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\">&nbsp;Bookkeeping &gt;&gt; Select Client &gt;&gt; CIS &gt;&gt; Subcontractor</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9142765648/original/8TCfbOVDUo81umCLgMLCNLD9GUJ-FkoNsw.png?1635170359\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9142765648\"></strong></span><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Under action please click the edit dropdown.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Then edit the work reference as necessary</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.co